[kiruna_demo_gen://default]
* Stateful synthetic generator for the Kiirunavaara Mine Demo.
* Reads [generator] in lkab_kiruna_demo_settings.conf on every tick.
* Writes only to the kiruna_events index and refuses any other index.
* No params required.
talk_label = <string>
* Optional free-text label for this stanza. Not written into events.
